id=vdhs_zygisk
name=VD-PicoEnhance
version=1.0.9
versionCode=10
author=VD-PicoEnhance contributors
description=Brings PICO optical hand tracking and Quest-style hand passthrough to the unmodified official Virtual Desktop on PICO 4 (no eye/face tracking hardware; eye-gaze code removed), and keeps the system hand gestures from interrupting it. Experimental; needs root + Zygisk. Does not modify the APK.
